  "notes": "{負担|ふたん} refers to a burden or responsibility one must bear.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {負担|ふたん}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{掛|か}ける: to impose a burden on\n- {負担|ふたん}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{大|おお}きい: the burden is heavy\n- {負担|ふたん}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{減|へ}らす: to reduce the burden\n- {自己|じこ}{負担|ふたん}: self-payment, out-of-pocket expense\n\nUSAGE:\n- For expenses: ⟦{費用|ひよう}→費用：03588_hiyou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{負担|ふたん}する (to bear the costs)\n- For physical strain: {身体|からだ}⟦への→への：00314_ni⟧{負担|ふたん} (strain on the body)",
